  "title": "Crispiest Buttermilk Fried Chicken",
  "description": "This is the crispiest fried chicken that you will prepare. It features a buttermilk and flour-based cayenne coating, deep fried to crispy perfection, perfect for picnics.",
  "authors": [
    "Sharon L"
  ],
